```

---

### **Summary**
| Issue | Line | Fix |
|-------|------|-----|
| Aggregates disabled | ~268 | Uncomment `aggregate: aggregates` |
| Multi-header crash in `CommonJS.js` | `ExcelExport` | Wrap in try-catch |
| Silent failure | `excelExport` handler | Catch errors so export proceeds |

The try-catch is the critical fix — it lets the Excel file generate even if the custom header styling crashes.

